{"ts":"2026-07-29T18:28:16.552Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"8e44c177d404faaccfcac65c","agent_provenance":{"model":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-29T18:28:16.552Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-29T18:28:16.551Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Implementation evidence: quality:context-eval now executes the shipped CLI retrieval evaluator against the committed tracker corpus, checks query count plus nDCG/MRR/precision/recall against a versioned baseline, and runs an impossible perfect-score negative control that must exit nonzero. The query set grew from four saturated single-relevance judgments to five queries including an 11-item judgment set with partial recall. Live metrics: nDCG 0.6223, MRR 0.55, precision 0.16, recall 0.8545; the non-saturated query recall is 0.2727. Gate claims are cross-checked against the enforced workflow registry."}]}],"before_hash":"706903d0a793f91418a3225a8066c4d5402ebf5497fb10221d47f10dd1fb32d4","after_hash":"afb9f7dfa33c1d2ebb0c68d5c1f6cc2774cdfdb4020be90e947099645f7e3892"}
{"ts":"2026-07-29T18:28:17.848Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"8e44c177d404faaccfcac65c","agent_provenance":{"model":null},"op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-29T18:28:17.848Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-29T18:28:17.848Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Baseline updates are explicit via --update and retain a 0.02 metric margin; ordinary runs execute the built dist/cli.js with the repository tracker pinned through --pm-path and telemetry disabled for deterministic CI."}]}],"before_hash":"afb9f7dfa33c1d2ebb0c68d5c1f6cc2774cdfdb4020be90e947099645f7e3892","after_hash":"faa71d75bf519be99204543dbccd0dac9a2be59f1fd7bff1662145db793b1b14"}
{"ts":"2026-07-29T18:28:18.904Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"8e44c177d404faaccfcac65c","agent_provenance":{"model":null},"op":"learning_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-29T18:28:18.904Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/learnings","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-29T18:28:18.904Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"A retrieval threshold is not a negative control when every query has one relevant item and recall is saturated. Multi-relevant judgments plus an executable impossible threshold prove the CLI failure path and make ranking regressions observable."}]}],"before_hash":"faa71d75bf519be99204543dbccd0dac9a2be59f1fd7bff1662145db793b1b14","after_hash":"09dde5c0b5a817ba68a3add91d8542c9eac156267bd415eb67e6252a682d97a9"}
